# Allowlist: the hosted runner image needs only the deepdoc package and the
# runner itself. Everything else (web/, tests/, docs/, vscode-extension/, .git)
# would bloat the build context and the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!deepdoc/
!hosted-runner/
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
deepdoc/video
deepdoc/generator/mdx_validator/node_modules
hosted-runner/.venv
hosted-runner/aws
